WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.552
Use Public Certificate Verification to check a certificate online.

2
00:00:08.632 --> 00:00:12.746
Open the verification page, scan its QR code or enter the available

3
00:00:12.826 --> 00:00:14.346
verification information.

4
00:00:14.426 --> 00:00:16.976
Review the result and certificate details.

5
00:00:17.056 --> 00:00:21.796
Every officially issued certificate carries a unique verification code and QR

6
00:00:21.876 --> 00:00:24.927
link pointing straight to its live registry entry.

7
00:00:25.007 --> 00:00:29.434
Type or scan a certificate ID into the verification search box and press

8
00:00:29.514 --> 00:00:31.034
Verify Credential.

9
00:00:31.114 --> 00:00:35.917
When valid, the registry clearly confirms Officially Verified status alongside

10
00:00:35.997 --> 00:00:40.738
the recipient name, award title, course or achievement, issuing organization,

11
00:00:40.818 --> 00:00:42.338
and issue date.

12
00:00:42.418 --> 00:00:46.533
Sample or personal drafts are never listed as verified, and revoked

13
00:00:46.613 --> 00:00:49.099
certificates display an explicit warning.

14
00:00:49.179 --> 00:00:53.732
You can also view approved organizations or submit a suspicious credential

15
00:00:53.812 --> 00:00:56.299
report directly for administrator review.

16
00:00:56.379 --> 00:00:57.899
Thank you for watching.
